==Description==
The '''Lovestruck Crate''' is an event crate, It has seventeen skins in total. It was first released for Valentine's Day 2025. Twelve of the skins return from previous Valentine's Day crates, while five are new.

Each skin that can be gotten from the '''Lovestruck Crate''' has a rarity which affects how likely you are to unlock the skin and the price when it appears in the Daily Skin Store. In the Daily Skin Store, {{Color|Common}} skins cost {{Coins|4,000}}, {{Color|Uncommon}} skins cost {{Coins|4,500}}, {{Color|Rare}} skins cost {{Coins|5,500}} and {{Color|Legendary}} skins cost {{Coins|7,000}}.

The '''Lovestruck Crate''' is a pink and white romantic gold chest with heart decorations. A heart-shaped lock can be found on the chest, which is used to open the crate with a golden heart key.

==Methods of Obtaining==
#Purchasable in the store for {{Robux|199}}.
